1
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,793
Nuggo: Brickley! I have solved mornings!

2
00:00:05,093 --> 00:00:06,890
Brickley: It's three in the afternoon.

3
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:09,492
Nuggo: Exactly! I slept right through the problem.

4
00:00:10,231 --> 00:00:10,682
Nuggo: Behold!

5
00:00:11,781 --> 00:00:12,817
Nuggo: The Snooze-O-Matic!

6
00:00:13,117 --> 00:00:15,732
Nuggo: It hits snooze for you, so you never have to wake up!

7
00:00:16,032 --> 00:00:18,624
Brickley: So it's a box that makes you late.

8
00:00:18,924 --> 00:00:19,738
Nuggo: Efficiently late!

9
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:21,223
Nuggo: Watch this!

10
00:00:23,923 --> 00:00:24,913
Nuggo: Ha! It works!

11
00:00:26,362 --> 00:00:28,077
Nuggo: Phase one... a total success.

12
00:00:29,217 --> 00:00:30,989
Brickley: Does it have an off switch?

13
00:00:31,289 --> 00:00:32,959
Nuggo: Off switches are for quitters!

14
00:00:35,849 --> 00:00:37,281
Nuggo: See? Now it's well rested.

15
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:40,961
Brickley: Subscribe, before he invents breakfast.
